    "updated_at": "2019-09-30T11:04:06Z",
    "body": "I wonder if there is a better way to get the region since `aws configure get region` is kinda slow (at least on my machine).\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ hyperfine \"aws configure get region\"\r\nBenchmark #1: aws configure get region\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):     680.2 ms ±  83.1 ms    [User: 536.8 ms, System: 107.5 ms]\r\n  Range (min … max):   603.9 ms … 825.1 ms    10 runs\r\n```",
